    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >wake Up!</h2><br>Have you ever thought that everything around you is just a <strong>believable dream</strong>?<br><br>Welcome to the captivating world of puzzles and surreal adventures - &quot;Wake Up&quot;! In this game, you will find yourself in an ordinary office space where you need to understand whether you are asleep or in reality. &quot;Wake Up&quot; is a game in which you will explore the surrounding environment, find logical inconsistencies, and try to reach reality.<br><br>But be careful. Shooting yourself in a dream means waking up. Shooting yourself in reality means dying. In &quot;Wake Up,&quot; you will need to use your intelligence and sharpen your attention to not miss any details.<br><br>Are you ready for an exciting journey into the world of surrealism and puzzles? Then download &quot;Wake Up&quot; and start your journey right now!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >wake Up!</h2><br>Have you ever thought that everything around you is just a <strong>believable dream</strong>?<br><br>Welcome to the captivating world of puzzles and surreal adventures - &quot;Wake Up&quot;! In this game, you will find yourself in an ordinary office space where you need to understand whether you are asleep or in reality. &quot;Wake Up&quot; is a game in which you will explore the surrounding environment, find logical inconsistencies, and try to reach reality.<br><br>But be careful. Shooting yourself in a dream means waking up. Shooting yourself in reality means dying. In &quot;Wake Up,&quot; you will need to use your intelligence and sharpen your attention to not miss any details.<br><br>Are you ready for an exciting journey into the world of surrealism and puzzles? Then download &quot;Wake Up&quot; and start your journey right now!",
    "short_description": "This game is a 3D puzzles and first-person shooter elements. Explore an office space and try to understand whether you are in a dream or in reality. Be attentive and not miss any details, as time is running out. Remember: dying in a dream means waking up, while dying in reality means simply dying.",
